sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Engineer
    participant Repo as Repository
    participant Ruff as ruff
    participant Mypy as mypy
    participant Pip as pip
    participant Test as pytest

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Dev,Test: === Phase A: T01 基础设施清理 ===
        Dev->>Repo: 删除 test_*.txt (24), .history/ (349 files, 5.8MB)
        Dev->>Repo: 删除 _ruff_*.json (5), _*.py (10), _*.txt (4)
        Dev->>Repo: 删除 out.log, .flake8
        Dev->>Repo: pyproject.toml: 删除 [tool.flake8]/[tool.black]/[tool.basedpyright]
        Dev->>Repo: .env.example: 与 os.getenv() 交叉比对
        Dev->>Repo: requirements-dev.txt: 删 black/flake8 → 加 ruff>=0.9.0
        Dev->>Repo: .gitignore: 加 _ruff_*.json 规则
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Dev,Test: === Phase B: T02 死分支消除 + 依赖降级 ===
        Dev->>Repo: engine.py: 删除 GPU_CONFIG_MANAGER_AVAILABLE
        Dev->>Repo: engine.py: 删除 ASYNC_LOG_AVAILABLE，内联 True
        Dev->>Pip: pip install "cachetools<7.0" "numpy<2.0" "pyopencl<2026.0"
        Pip-->>Dev: 降级成功
        Dev->>Pip: pip freeze > requirements.lock
    end

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Dev,Test: === Phase C: T03 PYOPENCL_AVAILABLE 单源化 ===
        Dev->>Repo: 新建 src/gpu/_availability.py
        Note over Repo: 唯一 try/except ImportError pyopencl
        Dev->>Repo: device.py: 删本地定义 → from ._availability import
        Dev->>Repo: kernel_impl.py: 删本地定义 → from ._availability import
        Dev->>Repo: engine.py: 删本地定义 → from ...gpu._availability import
        Dev->>Repo: 15测试文件: patch 路径统一为 src.gpu._availability.PYOPENCL_AVAILABLE
        Test->>Test: pytest 验证全绿
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 255)
        Note over Dev,Test: === Phase D: T04 P1 代码质量统一 ===
        Ruff->>Ruff: ruff --fix: I001(导入排序), Q000(引号), UP(现代化)
        Dev->>Repo: 运行 ruff format 统一格式
        Mypy->>Mypy: 逐 override block 修复类型错误
        Note over Mypy: Block1: wizard_engine/cli.output/kernel_protocol
        Note over Mypy: Block2: dashboard/worker/platform_check/timeout...
        Note over Mypy: Block3: buffer_tracker __slots__
        Note over Mypy: Block4: auto_test/performance_benchmark
        Note over Mypy: Block5: kernel_impl/device/engine... (24 files)
        Note over Mypy: Block6: fast_json/_shared/alert_system... (10 files)
        Note over Mypy: Block7: _result_processor/metrics/key_generator... (7 files)
        Dev->>Repo: 删除 pyproject.toml 中 7 个 ignore_errors block
        Dev->>Repo: requirements-*.txt 版本同步 pyproject.toml (P1-17)
        Dev->>Repo: 绝对导入转换 (P1-18)
        Dev->>Repo: shebang 清理 25文件 (P1-19)
        Dev->>Repo: f-string 转换 50处 (P1-21)
        Dev->>Repo: 常量 4→1 整合: 新建 src/constants.py (P1-22)
        Dev->>Repo: 4旧常量文件 → re-export
        Test->>Test: ruff check + mypy + pytest 全绿
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 255)
        Note over Dev,Test: === Phase E: T05 P2 最终收尾 ===
        Dev->>Repo: pyproject.toml: 逐步启用 mypy strict 子标志
        Dev->>Repo: src/: 修复 N8xx 命名违规
        Dev->>Repo: .pre-commit-config.yaml: black/flake8 → ruff + mypy hook
        Dev->>Repo: .gitignore: 精简 335→≤50 行
        Dev->>Repo: ROADMAP.md: 更新标准化完成状态
        Dev->>Repo: pytest.ini: 删除 DeprecationWarning 抑制
        Test->>Test: CI 全绿验证
    end
